*** Test Cases ***

# [1]5GC001586_C_TC_04_5GC001586-C_NSA_Check_cellsetup_1586_C_activated
# [1]5GC001586_C_TC_16_5GC001586-C_NSA_Check_NSA_5g_call_with_1586-C_activated
